# ── Test audio ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately NOT tracked: the two files in the project root are ~300 MB
# together (primer-final.flac alone is 270 MB), which would bloat the repo
# permanently and slow every clone down.
#
# Drop your own audio into the project root and the server picks it up
# automatically — nothing here depends on a specific filename.
# To track one anyway:  git add -f my-track.flac
*.wav
*.wave
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.weba
*.aif
*.aiff
*.caf
media/

# ── Generated by the test run ───────────────────────────────────────────────
test/shots/

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOTE: oscilloscope-standalone.html IS generated by build-standalone.js, but
# it is also a shipped deliverable (the single-file edition you can hand to
# someone), so it is intentionally tracked. Re-run `node build-standalone.js`
# after touching anything under public/.
